WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:03.133
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:04.601
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.601 --> 00:00:05.968
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.968 --> 00:00:07.200
Florida Governor
Ron DeSantis yesterday

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.400
signed a bill that allows
residents to carry

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.501
concealed loaded weapons
without a permit.

00:00:11.501 --> 00:00:14.968
UConn won the NCAA tournament,
and Finland join NATO.

00:00:14.968 --> 00:00:17.634
And I think that's
all the other stuff.

00:00:17.634 --> 00:00:22.634
Now, former president Trump
was arraigned today

00:00:22.634 --> 00:00:24.234
inside the New York
County Criminal Court

00:00:24.234 --> 00:00:25.601
in lower Manhattan.

00:00:25.601 --> 00:00:28.534
And I think it really says
something that the craziest part

00:00:28.534 --> 00:00:31.467
of that sentence
is still "former president."

00:00:31.467 --> 00:00:36.167
That guy was the president
of the country.

00:00:36.167 --> 00:00:38.801
If you asked for the manager
at Best Buy

00:00:38.801 --> 00:00:43.734
and that guy came over,
you'd say, "No, the manager."

00:00:45.467 --> 00:00:46.767
That's right --
former president Trump

00:00:46.767 --> 00:00:48.200
was arraigned today
in Manhattan.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:50.734
And like anyone else,
Trump is presumed innocent

00:00:50.734 --> 00:00:53.868
until he outright confesses
on Truth Social.

00:00:56.067 --> 00:00:59.367
Trump was arraigned today
inside a New York courtroom.

00:00:59.367 --> 00:01:02.834
Cameras weren't allowed, but
they did have a sketch artist.

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:07.968
Former president Trump
was set to speak tonight

00:01:07.968 --> 00:01:10.400
at Mar-a-Lago following his
arraignment today in New York.

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:14.033
Wait. They're letting him go?

00:01:14.033 --> 00:01:15.934
Does anything scream
flight risk

00:01:15.934 --> 00:01:19.567
more than a guy
with his own plane?

00:01:19.567 --> 00:01:22.033
It's a flight guarantee.

00:01:22.033 --> 00:01:24.167
Attorney Todd Blanche announced
yesterday that he's joined

00:01:24.167 --> 00:01:25.934
former president Trump's
criminal defense team

00:01:25.934 --> 00:01:27.400
and said joining the team was

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:29.534
"an opportunity
he could not pass up."

00:01:29.534 --> 00:01:32.067
An opportunity to what?
Also go to prison?

00:01:32.067 --> 00:01:35.267
Yeah, I mean, who wouldn't want
to join the illustrious ranks

00:01:35.267 --> 00:01:36.901
of Michael Cohen
and the guy who didn't know

00:01:36.901 --> 00:01:40.234
Four Seasons was a hotel?

00:01:40.234 --> 00:01:42.133
New York Mayor
Eric Adams warned yesterday

00:01:42.133 --> 00:01:44.400
that the city is prepared for
former president Trump's

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:46.467
arraignment and said,
"While there may be

00:01:46.467 --> 00:01:48.200
some rabble-rousers
thinking about coming

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:50.467
to our city tomorrow, our
message is clear and simple --

00:01:50.467 --> 00:01:51.767
control yourselves."

00:01:51.767 --> 00:01:56.734
My question is, where was
that leadership before SantaCon?

00:01:59.968 --> 00:02:02.067
Kellen Curry,
an Afghanistan war veteran

00:02:02.067 --> 00:02:03.901
and former executive
at J.P. Morgan,

00:02:03.901 --> 00:02:05.968
announced this week
that he will challenge New York

00:02:05.968 --> 00:02:08.734
Congressman George Santos in
the Republican primary.

00:02:08.734 --> 00:02:11.567
Sounds impressive.
Do we have a photo of Curry?

00:02:11.567 --> 00:02:13.167
George!

00:02:16.167 --> 00:02:18.734
Disney C.E.O. Bob Iger
criticized Florida Governor

00:02:18.734 --> 00:02:20.734
Ron DeSantis yesterday
for his decision

00:02:20.734 --> 00:02:23.767
to strip the company of its
special self-governing status

00:02:23.767 --> 00:02:28.133
and, to get him back, announced
Minnie is just Mickey in drag.

00:02:30.801 --> 00:02:32.300
Paris residents over the weekend

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:34.267
voted to ban electric scooters
from the city,

00:02:34.267 --> 00:02:36.634
which is wise, because
it's really hard to fall in love

00:02:36.634 --> 00:02:41.000
with someone once you've
seen them ride a scooter.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:43.200
And, finally,
today was Tell a Lie Day.

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:45.334
Said one celebrant,
"Not guilty."

00:02:45.334 --> 00:02:48.434
And that -- You guys,
that was the monologue.

00:02:48.434 --> 00:02:49.801
We're off and running.
[ Cheers and applause ]

